What's This?
~~~~~~~~~~~~
This is a TOP 10 List Generator for MAX's Byte Ratio System v1.0 UL/D..
and MAX's Built in Upload/Download/Messages/Calls/Files


Contents Of Archive
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
MAX-TopGen     - The Program for UL/DL/Calls/Messages/Files
MBRS-TopGen    - The Program for MBRS UL/DL
TurboTop.DOC   - This doc file you are reading now.
TurboTop.txt   - A little script file for updating...


Usage
~~~~~
Run MAX-TopGen from CLI and you will see:

---------------------------------------------------
TurboTop v1.1 © Christian Vigard / TurboSoft - 1996

Usage: TurboTop <Option> <OutPut>

Options:        U = Top Uploaders
                D = Top Downloaders
                C = Top Callers
                A = Top Authors
                F = Top Files
About/Info:     ? = For Some Information
----------------------------------------

Example:

TurboTop U RAM:TopUL.Text
'''''''' * ++++++++++++++

' = The Program

* = Top Uploaders

+ = Output File....

Pretty Easy? ;)


Show The "RAM:TopUL.Text" In Your BBS
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

key:  function:  extra:  lo acc:  hi acc:  filename/name/dest/path:
-------------------------------------------------------------------
 *      13         0         *       *     RAM:TopUL.Text


Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
1. Move all the files to "BBS:Utils/TurboTop/"

2. Link keys for all the TopLists.Text's
   (Look At The "Usage" Part in this Doc)

3. HOW TO UPDATE LISTS:
   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   I recommend that you run all the programs on a SYSEVENT.

   You can do it like this:

   Type "Execute [Path To Your TurboTop Dir]/TurboTop.txt"

   And woila you have fresh TopLists :)...


NOTE ** The Programs will NOT skip the first user, if you the programs to
        skip the first user then contact me and I'll make you a special
        version. **

4. Edit the TurboTop.Txt so it suits you needs.

5. Now test all the programs so they are working...

They works perfect on my A1200/030/50..  ;)

